OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 35, charged with murder of
OL,4,ACarrie Mullane
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder by
OL,7,Fpolice investigating the disappearance
OL,8,Fand suspected murder of Carrie Mullane
OL,9,F(Noonan).
OL,11,FMullane, who is 39, has been missing
OL,12,Fsince she arrived in Enniskillen from
OL,13,FLimerick on 10 October 2026.
OL,15,FThe 35-year-old man is also charged
OL,16,Fwith preventing the lawful burial of a
OL,17,Fcorpse.
OL,19,FHe is due to appear via video link
OL,20,Fbefore Dungannon Magistrates' Court on
OL,21,F7 November.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
